{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12323","headline":"东溪杜野人致酒 · 钱起","name":"东溪杜野人致酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万重云树下，数亩子平居。\n野院罗泉石，荆扉背里闾。\n早冬耕凿暇，弋雁复烹鱼。\n静扫寒花径，唯邀傲吏车。\n晚来留客好，小雪下山初。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}